From 54a9d15d13b76c53cd5fc3eac6a41239db0491f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yaegerbomb42 <yaeger.james42@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:00:36 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(harness): risk-gate tool calls with approval flow
 (allow/ask/deny)

Introduces a pure command/tool classifier (lib/harness/risk.ts) with 48
table-driven verdict rows. Ask-classified tool.call events now emit an
approval.required telemetry event and pause the run (async gate chain) until
POST /api/runtime/approvals/{id} approves or denies via an in-memory store
with a TTL expiry. Deny-classified calls block immediately with tool.blocked.
Adds store and E2E tests (runner gate + API route).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
